<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean prosecutors confirm union leaders summons.</title>
<headline>S.Korean prosecutors confirm union leaders summons.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean state prosecutors on Monday summoned for questioning about 20 leaders of an outlawed umbrella union group, a senior prosecutor said.</p>
<p>&quot;We have summoned about 20 leaders of the Korean Confederation of Trade Unions to report to prosecution offices tomorrow,&quot; Lee Sang-hyong told Reuters.</p>
</text>
